---
layout: layouts/page.njk
title: Projects
lede: The software, hardware and community platform GMOOCA is building, with where each one stands today. Most of what we earn goes back into this work.
description: Progress on GMOOCA Gaming Manager 2 and 3 (SAS and G2S slot machine management software), the GMOOCA SAS Gateway hardware, and the GMOOCA community forums.
permalink: /projects/
prose: false
---
<p class="band-meta">Last updated <time datetime="{{ projects | latestUpdate }}">{{ projects | latestUpdate | readableDate }}</time>. Release dates aren't promised until a project reaches testing.</p>

{% for p in projects %}
{% set current = p | phaseIndex %}
<section class="project-full" id="{{ p.id }}" aria-labelledby="{{ p.id }}-h">
  <div class="project-full-head">
    <p class="project-kind">{{ p.kind }}</p>
    <h2 id="{{ p.id }}-h">{{ p.name }}</h2>
  </div>
  <div class="project-full-body">
    <div class="prose">
      <p class="lead-in">{{ p.summary }}</p>
      {% for para in p.details %}<p>{{ para | md | safe }}</p>{% endfor %}
      {% if p.page %}<p><a class="text-link" href="{{ p.page }}">{% if p.page.startsWith("/hardware/#") %}See it on the hardware page{% else %}Concept images and details{% endif %}</a></p>{% endif %}
      {% if p.next %}
      <h3 class="side-h">Coming next</h3>
      <dl class="next-list">
        {% for n in p.next %}<div><dt>{{ n.label }}</dt><dd>{{ n.text }}</dd></div>{% endfor %}
      </dl>
      {% endif %}
    </div>
    <div class="project-side">
      <h3 class="side-h">Stage</h3>
      <ol class="phases" aria-label="{{ p.name }} progress: {{ p.phase }} phase">
        {% for ph in p.phases %}
        <li class="{% if loop.index0 < current %}done{% elif loop.index0 == current %}now{% endif %}"{% if loop.index0 == current %} aria-current="step"{% endif %}><span>{{ ph }}</span></li>
        {% endfor %}
      </ol>
      <p class="project-note">{{ p.note }}</p>
      <h3 class="side-h">History</h3>
      <ol class="log" reversed>
        {% for entry in p.log %}
        <li><time datetime="{{ entry.date }}">{{ entry.date | readableDate }}</time><span>{{ entry.text }}</span></li>
        {% endfor %}
      </ol>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
{% endfor %}

<div class="callout">
  <h2>Want to hear when something ships?</h2>
  <p>Leave your email on the <a href="/Community/#notify">community page</a>. We'll write when the forums open, and we'll post project news there first.</p>
</div>
